## Summary
The owner's own Loom (Thoughtform_Website Inspiration.mp4, recorded 2026-10-11). The speaker is looking to refine the visual identity and UX of the "Thoughtform" brand, moving away from previous design proposals that felt chaotic or "Frankenstein" (and which gave him "anxiety").

